">\n\t\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Island\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Region</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/River_Caves\" title=\"River Caves\">River Caves</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Building\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Building</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/River_Shop\" title=\"River Shop\">River Shop</a></div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tab__content\">\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Date Added</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">?</div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t</section>\n\n\n\n</aside>\n\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\">Description</span></h2>\n<p><b>Lumi Laurence</b> is the shopkeeper of the <a href=\"/wiki/River_Shop\" title=\"River Shop\">River Shop</a> located in the <a href=\"/wiki/River_Caves\" title=\"River Caves\">River Caves</a>. Interact with Lumi Laurence to convert raw <a href=\"/wiki/Lumite\" title=\"Lumite\">Lumite</a> into Credits used as the currency in his store. \n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Trivia\">Trivia</span></h2>\n<p><b>= These messeges below was according to both Lumi and Raffina creator, Ponna.</b>\n</p><p>- Lumi Laurence is a ten thousand years old Ancient Golem that lived in the island before humans have taken over.\n</p><p>- Lumi Laurence likes the wet rocky caves, that's why he built his shop behind the waterfall.\n</p><p>- If Lumi Laurence has hobbies, it would probably be gardening and collecting Lumite.\n</p><p>- Lumi Laurence and <a href=\"/wiki/Raffina_Caldera\" title=\"Raffina Caldera\">Raffina Caldera</a> are supposed to be ex-partners. But Lumi felt like this isn't right because he dislikes magma, so he was the one who broke up and when they see eachother they will start fights.\n</p><p>- Lumi Laurence is male and if comparing to human ages, he's probably around 20 or 30 years old.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Concept_Art\">Concept Art</span></h2>\n<p>These concepts below were made by <b>Ponna</b>.\n</p>\n<div id=\"gallery-0\" hash=\"f6bfd105b5c889820f97e00c72f3aad6\" data-seq-no=\"0\" class=\"wikia-gallery wikia-gallery-caption-below wikia-gallery-position-left wikia-gallery-spacing-medium wikia-gallery-border-small wikia-gallery-captions-left wikia-gallery-caption-size-medium\"><div class=\"wikia-gallery-caption\"></div><div class=\"wikia-gallery-item\" style=\"width:187px; \"><div class=\"thumb\" style=\"height:187px;\"><div class=\"gallery-image-wrapper accent\" id=\"Lumi_Laurence_Concept1-png\" style=\"position: relative; height:184px; width:159px; top:0.5px;\"><a class=\"image lightbox\" href=\"/wiki/File:Lumi_Laurence_Concept1.png\" title=\"Lumi Laurence Concept1.png (67 KB)\" style=\"height:184px; width:159px;\"><noscript><img style=\"\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/3/35/Lumi_Laurence_Concept1.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/160?cb=20240328141256\" title=\"Lumi Laurence Concept1.png (67 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage\" alt=\"\" height=\"185\" width=\"185\" data-image-name=\"Lumi Laurence Concept1.png\" data-image-key=\"Lumi_Laurence_Concept1.png\" data-relevant=\"1\"></noscript><img style=\"\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" title=\"Lumi Laurence Concept1.png (67 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage lazyload\" alt=\"\" height=\"185\" width=\"185\" data-image-name=\"Lumi Laurence Concept1.png\" data-image-key=\"Lumi_Laurence_Concept1.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/3/35/Lumi_Laurence_Concept1.pn